    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "A contactless magnetic shaft coupling: two hubs each carry a ring of disc magnets, so placed face to face (or across a thin non-magnetic wall) they transmit torque with no physical link — driving a shaft through a sealed barrier, or slipping harmlessly on overload. Choose the driving/driven hub, a thin magnet-carrier disc, or a cup shell for a through-wall coupling. The shaft bore is a round or D-flat 6/8 mm fit with a set-screw — the same shaft interface as knob-dshaft.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Un acoplamiento magnetico de eje sin contacto: dos cubos llevan cada uno un anillo de imanes de disco, asi que puestos cara a cara (o a traves de una pared no magnetica delgada) transmiten par sin union fisica — accionando un eje a traves de una barrera sellada, o resbalando sin dano ante sobrecarga. Elige el cubo motriz/conducido, un disco delgado porta-imanes, o una carcasa de copa para acoplamiento a traves de pared. El barreno del eje es un ajuste redondo o de plano D de 6/8 mm con prisionero — la misma interfaz de eje que knob-dshaft.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/magnetic-coupling.webp",
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": ["hybrid", "magnetic", "coupling", "shaft", "contactless", "torque", "magnets", "hyperobject", "commons"],
